    356  42f9							; throne: the throne room, each frame of the game. The
    357  42f9							; crown on the throne: the blade breaks it, VICTORY
    358  42f9							; (CROWN_POINTS, the first byte of the score, and
    359  42f9							; ENERGY_POINTS for each unit of energy left). The King:
    360  42f9							; - after a blow he flashes for KHIT_FRAMES, and no blow
    361  42f9							;   counts; otherwise a blade on him is a blow
    362  42f9							;   (KHIT_BCD points), and the KING_HITS-th beats him: the
    363  42f9							;   crown takes his place (KING_BCD points), the venom is
    364  42f9							;   gone;
    365  42f9							; - his bite: their boxes meet and no wound is counting
    366  42f9							;   (BITE_DAMAGE);
    367  42f9							; - the venom, while it flies: VEN_INT pixels a frame and
    368  42f9							;   one more when its fraction carries, on the lines of his
    369  42f9							;   mouth; it is gone past its free pixels (VSPAN: stone,
    370  42f9							;   the edge) or on Sir Roderick: parried by the shield if
    371  42f9							;   it comes from the side he faces and he is not thrusting
    372  42f9							;   (he shows the parry for PARRY_FRAMES), else a wound
    373  42f9							;   (VENOM_DAMAGE) unless one is counting;
    374  42f9							; - otherwise he goes a step of 2 lines (when the fraction
    375  42f9							;   of KSTEP_FRAC carries) towards the top line that puts
    376  42f9							;   his mouth at Sir Roderick's middle (ky + 2, kept between
    377  42f9							;   KING_T0 and KING_T1); when the time before a spit is
    378  42f9							;   over and he is there, he spits towards Sir Roderick's
    379  42f9							;   side: the venom starts beside him, and the time before
    380  42f9							;   the next spit is shorter the more blows he has had
    381  42f9							;   (SPIT).
